meta {
  name: Sort Order
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/{{table}}/sort-order
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:json {
  {
    "sort_order": [3, 1, 2]
  }
}

docs {
  YOZUVLARNI qayta tartiblash (fayllarni emas).
  
  Ruxsat etilgan table:
    socials | features | metrics | coaches | directions | trial-benefits | advantages | onboarding-steps | branches | trial-offers | usefuls
  (coache-categories bu yerda YOQ - unda sort_order ustuni mavjud emas)
  (pages va menu bu yerda yo'q - menyu uchun 08-Menu / Menu Sort Order ishlatiladi)
  
  - takroriy ID bo'lsa 400
  - mavjud bo'lmagan ID bo'lsa 404
  - hammasi bitta tranzaksiyada bajariladi
}
